# Rust build output. Cargo.lock is deliberately NOT ignored here - this
# workspace ships binaries (devialet-remote-daemon, devialet-ctl), and the
# convention for binary crates (unlike pure libraries) is to commit the
# lockfile for reproducible builds.
/target/
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

# QML tooling caches, if ever generated locally (e.g. via qmlcachegen, or
# running the plasmoid through plasmoidviewer/kpackagetool once real
# plasmoid packaging exists in a later phase).
*.qmlc
.qmlls.ini

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Local env / secrets, if ever introduced
.env
